			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3800
			},
			"text": "一张图片,凭什么能被当成一句话来读?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,800",
				"to": "00:00:08,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3800,
				"to": 8300
			},
			"text": "把它切成16*16的小块,每一块就是一个词。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:08,300",
				"to": "00:00:11,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 8300,
				"to": 11400
			},
			"text": "这就是Vision Transformers做的事。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:11,400",
				"to": "00:00:15,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 11400,
				"to": 15200
			},
			"text": "阶段期,第九课,Vision Transformers。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:15,200",
				"to": "00:00:19,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 15200,
				"to": 19000
			},
			"text": "2020年之前,视觉几乎等于卷机。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,000",
				"to": "00:00:23,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19000,
				"to": 23900
			},
			"text": "这篇论文把卷机彻底丢掉,只留下切块和注意力。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:23,900",
				"to": "00:00:29,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 23900,
				"to": 29600
			},
			"text": "ImageNet, Coco,检测基准,每个sota都用CNN骨干。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:29,600",
				"to": "00:00:34,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 29600,
				"to": 34600
			},
			"text": "Transformers,当时是给语言用的,没人觉得它适合图像。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:34,600",
				"to": "00:00:39,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 34600,
				"to": 39500
			},
			"text": "DosovicsP等人2020年的论文打破了这个假设。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:39,500",
				"to": "00:00:47,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 39500,
				"to": 47000
			},
			"text": "把224*224的图像切成16*16的小块,得到196个patch。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:47,000",
				"to": "00:00:50,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 47000,
				"to": 50900
			},
			"text": "每个patch摊平乘长度768的像量。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,900",
				"to": "00:00:56,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50900,
				"to": 56200
			},
			"text": "在代码里,就是一次按行扫描,顺序和所有VIT一致。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:56,200",
				"to": "00:01:01,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 56200,
				"to": 61000
			},
			"text": "一个学道的矩阵,把每个patch投影到地下画线model。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:01,000",
				"to": "00:01:06,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 61000,
				"to": 66400
			},
			"text": "它等价于一个卷机和大小为16,不长也为16的卷机。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:06,400",
				"to": "00:01:11,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 66400,
				"to": 71300
			},
			"text": "Pet torch里两行就能写完,但它是整个视觉化的入口。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:11,300",
				"to": "00:01:15,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 71300,
				"to": 75400
			},
			"text": "在最前面,加一个可学习的CLS token。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:15,400",
				"to": "00:01:19,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 75400,
				"to": 79200
			},
			"text": "它的最终隐藏状态,就是整张图的表示。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:19,200",
				"to": "00:01:23,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 79200,
				"to": 83600
			},
			"text": "位置编码告诉模型,每个patch,原本在哪个位置。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:23,600",
				"to": "00:01:27,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 83600,
				"to": 87000
			},
			"text": "然后,就是原封不动的Bird编码器。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:27,000",
				"to": "00:01:30,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 87000,
				"to": 90100
			},
			"text": "层规一画,自助异理,前馈。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:30,100",
				"to": "00:01:34,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 90100,
				"to": 94200
			},
			"text": "没有视觉专用的层,这是论文最漂亮的地方。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:34,200",
				"to": "00:01:37,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 94200,
				"to": 97400
			},
			"text": "卷机、持画,一个都没留下。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:37,400",
				"to": "00:01:42,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 97400,
				"to": 102800
			},
			"text": "分类时取CLS的输出,接一个线性层和Softmax。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:42,800",
				"to": "00:01:48,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 102800,
				"to": 108600
			},
			"text": "DINOVR和SAM会丢掉CLS,直接用patch欠入。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:48,600",
				"to": "00:01:52,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 108600,
				"to": 112700
			},
			"text": "同一个股价,换个头,就能做分割和检测。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:52,700",
				"to": "00:01:58,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 112700,
				"to": 118700
			},
			"text": "VIT没有卷机的归纳编制,既没有平衣不变性,也没有局部性。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:58,700",
				"to": "00:02:03,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 118700,
				"to": 123900
			},
			"text": "所以,要上一张图,或者强字监督,才能追平CNN。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:03,900",
				"to": "00:02:09,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 123900,
				"to": 129900
			},
			"text": "DIT用征流修了一半,DINOVR用字监督彻底修好。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:09,900",
				"to": "00:02:15,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 129900,
				"to": 135100
			},
			"text": "如果你只有一个小数据级,你会用VIT还是CNN。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:15,100",
